{"html":"<p>高频噪声麦克风阵列定位最合适不过了。既然你能听见，那应该离超声波还有一定距离。前提是麦克风阵列嗷嗷贵……</p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e7e34cbb23df2726857f67d72925486e_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>gfai声学照相机</figcaption></figure><p>如果是低频的话，就要上Microflown阵列了</p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-824aa060875f6ec6377d1dc75079589d_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Microflown声学照相机[https://www.microflown.com/products/arrays/hand-held-array/]</figcaption></figure>"}
